        {
          "text": "Abalo bamasi bayooziba kuti nkekambo kazibi zyabo luzubo lwa-Israyeli neebatolelwa mubuzike, nkaambo bakapapila ndime, aboobo ndakasisa busyu bwangu kulimbabo akubaaba mumaanza aabasinkondonyina mane boonse bakajazigwa ipanga. ",
