          "text": "Lino bayooziba kuti ndime Jehova Leza wabo, nkaambo ndime ndakabanjizya mubuzike muzisi zyabamasi, alimwi ndime ndakababoozya alimwi kunyika yabo. Nsikooyoosia limbi naba omwe wabo akati kabamasi, ",
